tatus","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"43fcc2f44ce938e0\" href=\"?note=43fcc2f44ce938e0\" title=\"68-df-turing-degree\">68-df-turing-degree</a>，度序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Minimal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Minimal}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c98683963f144de2\" href=\"?note=c98683963f144de2\" title=\"68-df-minimal-degree\">68-df-minimal-degree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{Minimal}(\\mathbf a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{Minimal}(\\mathbf a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathbf0&lt;\\deg(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;((\\mathbf0&lt;\\deg(B)\\land\\deg(B)\\le\\deg(A))\\Longrightarrow\\deg(B)=\\deg(A))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathbf0&lt;\\deg(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;((\\mathbf0&lt;\\deg(B)\\land\\deg(B)\\le\\deg(A))\\Longrightarrow\\deg(B)=\\deg(A))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是给定短书之外保留的极小度存在扩展，未核对外部来源或树构造证明。删除 Sacks r.e. 度分裂定理的证明依赖：它不是全度极小度存在的证明，反而说明非零 r.e. 度不能极小。旧 construction-of-minimal-degree 节点的概略约束也不能独自完成存在性证明，故不以它冒充已完成的构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-minimal-degree","status":"resolved","id":"c98683963f144de2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-minimal-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，$\\mathrm{Minimal}$ 见 [[68-df-minimal-degree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，$\\mathrm{Minimal}$ 见 [[68-df-minimal-degree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-minimal-degree","status":"resolved","id":"c98683963f144de2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，$\\mathrm{Minimal}$ 见 [[68-df-minimal-degree]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Minimal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathbf 